     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I am having some trouble determining why my application is giving me different values in the gauge (see in pictures) locally vs on the deployed version. The underlying code is the same between the two so my suspicion is that the version of some libraries on the local vs deployed apps aren&#39;t matching up. Here are all of the libraries used:<div><br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><div># Load packages app.R</div><div>library(shiny)</div><div>library(png)</div><div>library(flexdashboard)<br><br># Load helper<br>source(&quot;helpers.R&quot;)</div></div></code></div><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div># Load packages helpers.R<font color=\"#660066\"><br></font><div>library(data.table)</div><div>library(readr)</div><div>library(mlbench)</div><div>library(caret)</div><div>library(Amelia)</div><div>library(bnlearn)</div><div>library(arules)</div><div>library(randomForest)</div></div></code></div></div><div><br></div><div>Any help is much appreciated. Thank you.<br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Pictures:</div><div>Deployed=76.6% Gauge</div><div>Local=87.2% Gauge</div><div><br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--R0gURkqY9I/WvXGldFvecI/AAAAAAAAAAQ/2uZ11eNuGoM8WmFPBwG29nKRfSDjl65qgCLcBGAs/s1600/DeployedInterface5.11.18.PNG\" style=\"clear:left;margin-bottom:1em;float:left;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/--R0gURkqY9I/WvXGldFvecI/AAAAAAAAAAQ/2uZ11eNuGoM8WmFPBwG29nKRfSDjl65qgCLcBGAs/s1600/DeployedInterface5.11.18.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792359884153000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3WPSxyLU5RGbt6rMsCh72G\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercon